So bold, I guess you've already tampered with the CCTV.

794
00:54:55,717 --> 00:54:58,618
It's okay though, I don't need any evidence!

795
00:54:58,618 --> 00:55:02,218
I am ready to go to prison for this!

796
00:55:02,218 --> 00:55:05,609
I'm filing for an appeal tomorrow morning.

797
00:55:05,609 --> 00:55:09,717
I'll share this recording with everyone and turn myself in.

798
00:55:09,717 --> 00:55:13,525
We'll all go to prison. How exciting.

799
00:55:13,525 --> 00:55:15,400
Let's go!

800
00:55:15,400 --> 00:55:18,701
- What do we do?
- He's gone mad.

801
00:55:19,917 --> 00:55:22,300
What do you want?

802
00:55:22,318 --> 00:55:24,884
But, Sis...

803
00:55:25,901 --> 00:55:28,817
Making my wishes come true?

804
00:55:28,817 --> 00:55:31,784
Just tell me what you want!

805
00:55:35,750 --> 00:55:37,610
Sis!

806
00:55:42,192 --> 00:55:45,483
I am J. King!

807
00:56:20,184 --> 00:56:22,118
It's true.

808
00:56:22,151 --> 00:56:24,984
Teacher, you're back!

809
00:56:24,984 --> 00:56:26,192
Hello, Jihoo.

810
00:56:26,192 --> 00:56:26,942
Hello!

811
00:56:26,942 --> 00:56:28,817
- Hi, Sechan.
- Welcome back.

812
00:56:28,817 --> 00:56:31,117
- Hello!
- Teacher!

813
00:56:31,192 --> 00:56:33,901
- I missed you!
- I missed you, too.

814
00:56:33,901 --> 00:56:35,609
Hello, Jiho and Jinsu.

815
00:56:35,609 --> 00:56:38,192
Songhee did you hand in your field trip report?

816
00:56:38,192 --> 00:56:39,084
Yes!

817
00:56:39,084 --> 00:56:40,109
Good job.

818
00:56:40,109 --> 00:56:43,517
I missed you all.

819
00:56:43,517 --> 00:56:46,092
It's from my uncle.

820
00:56:52,609 --> 00:56:56,901
Dear junior in high school Song Hwaeum...

821
00:56:56,901 --> 00:57:01,309
It's me, J. King.

822
00:57:01,309 --> 00:57:03,483
Sorry for the late reply.

823
00:57:03,483 --> 00:57:06,217
Thank you so much for the keyring.

824
00:57:06,217 --> 00:57:09,984
Let's both make our dreams come true.

825
00:57:10,984 --> 00:57:13,984
I'll cheer for your dreams, too.

826
00:57:14,692 --> 00:57:18,909
10 years from now, you'll be an amazing teacher.

827
00:57:18,909 --> 00:57:23,300
Some students won't listen, and will annoy you,

828
00:57:23,300 --> 00:57:27,283
as well with some bossy parents, but...

829
00:57:27,283 --> 00:57:32,692
You will be loved and respected as the best teacher.

830
00:57:32,692 --> 00:57:38,792
So never give up on your dreams and keep hope.

831
00:57:39,909 --> 00:57:41,917
By the way, beanie girl.

832
00:57:41,917 --> 00:57:45,783
You should never think that you're useless.

833
00:57:45,783 --> 00:57:46,609
Hello!

834
00:57:46,609 --> 00:57:50,601
Even if you don't become something,

835
00:57:50,609 --> 00:57:55,283
you are already a precious human being.

836
00:57:55,283 --> 00:57:59,984
You deserve to be loved. From, J. King.

837
00:58:11,109 --> 00:58:13,383
Thank you for letting me work.

838
00:58:13,383 --> 00:58:15,392
Just be grateful.

839
00:58:16,292 --> 00:58:19,401
Just know it's thanks to me.

840
00:58:20,500 --> 00:58:22,400
Yes.

841
00:58:23,017 --> 00:58:24,601
Oh, and...

842
00:58:25,318 --> 00:58:27,583
- You and Noeul's father?
- Pardon?

843
00:58:27,583 --> 00:58:30,592
Why does he work so hard to help your family?

844
00:58:30,592 --> 00:58:35,001
He stole for you, got signatures, he's like your husband...

845
00:58:42,192 --> 00:58:44,183
Greetings from Cook Mom.

846
00:58:46,892 --> 00:58:50,817
- You live here?
- Congratulations, your back to work.

847
00:58:50,817 --> 00:58:51,984
Yes.

848
00:58:51,984 --> 00:58:56,292
I heard you helped. Thank you.

849
00:58:56,292 --> 00:58:58,542
Don't you want to know why?

850
00:58:59,984 --> 00:59:02,609
I didn't want you to move away.

851
00:59:05,650 --> 00:59:09,792
The school conversion isn't happening, so you won't move. Right?

852
00:59:11,067 --> 00:59:12,751
That's a given.

853
00:59:18,330 --> 00:59:19,910
Burning...

854
00:59:21,440 --> 00:59:23,240
Oh no!

855
00:59:44,350 --> 00:59:46,070
What should we do?

856
00:59:46,701 --> 00:59:51,617
You're hurt, let me clean that up for you.

857
00:59:51,617 --> 00:59:55,517
- I'll make you new fried eggs.
- That would be...

858
00:59:55,550 --> 00:59:57,150
Oh...

859
00:59:57,817 --> 00:59:59,640
It's okay...

860
01:00:01,000 --> 01:00:02,584
Just wait.

861
01:00:06,717 --> 01:00:08,901
I said we "lost" the files.

862
01:00:08,901 --> 01:00:12,400
I told the principal to collect new consent forms.

863
01:00:12,400 --> 01:00:16,800
Yes, I'll focus on collecting the forms as well.

864
01:00:16,800 --> 01:00:21,400
No, the school should take care of it now.

865
01:00:21,400 --> 01:00:24,092
Let's step away from this.

866
01:00:24,792 --> 01:00:30,992
Then the school system will never be able to change.

867
01:00:30,992 --> 01:00:33,817
Your approval ratings are up for now,

868
01:00:33,817 --> 01:00:36,220
but you never know what might happen.

869
01:00:36,220 --> 01:00:39,200
Above all else, it must mean that the housewives are in our favor.

870
01:00:39,200 --> 01:00:43,310
What do we do if this guy uses the forged documents against us?

871
01:00:43,318 --> 01:00:47,483
Which is why I advised you to edit me out

872
01:00:47,483 --> 01:00:50,884
of the CCTV and have him arrested for theft.

873
01:00:50,884 --> 01:00:54,817
Arrest him for stealing forged documents?

874
01:00:54,817 --> 01:00:58,775
If he was arrested, he would have no choice but to return them.

875
01:00:58,775 --> 01:01:02,609
You've never dealt with people like him.

876
01:01:02,609 --> 01:01:04,483
Mr. Congressman,

877
01:01:04,483 --> 01:01:07,984
I would do anything to make sure you win the election.

878
01:01:07,984 --> 01:01:12,475
I know how much you sacrifice for me.

879
01:01:12,475 --> 01:01:16,083
I appreciate your efforts, just be careful.

880
01:01:16,083 --> 01:01:19,684
You can find yourself in danger. Got it?

881
01:01:36,692 --> 01:01:37,901
Huh?

882
01:01:45,392 --> 01:01:49,083
Is this the only way?

883
01:01:49,792 --> 01:01:54,284
We must change everything back to normal.

884
01:01:56,909 --> 01:02:01,618
I don't know if this is the right move, whatever.

885
01:02:06,901 --> 01:02:08,484
Hello...

886
01:02:09,109 --> 01:02:11,609
- Hello...
- What the Hell is that?

887
01:02:11,609 --> 01:02:15,809
Dear Royal Estate residents, sorry for the interruption.

888
01:02:15,817 --> 01:02:19,775
- Isn't that Junhyeok's voice?
- No way.

889
01:02:19,775 --> 01:02:24,901
I'm the uncle living in the rental apartment 804.

890
01:02:24,901 --> 01:02:27,017
Did he lose his mind?

891
01:02:27,017 --> 01:02:29,010
I, as a person,

892
01:02:29,010 --> 01:02:30,700
am a good liar,

893
01:02:30,700 --> 01:02:34,109
who tries to refund his suit on purpose.

894
01:02:34,109 --> 01:02:38,792
I used to finish entire meals at the free tasting sections.

895
01:02:38,792 --> 01:02:43,300
But I am not a bad person who would harm others.

896
01:02:43,300 --> 01:02:45,540
- He's so annoying...
- I am not a molester,

897
01:02:45,540 --> 01:02:48,100
nor am I a pervert.

898
01:02:48,109 --> 01:02:55,183
Moving forward, I will show you that I am a good person.

899
01:02:55,817 --> 01:03:00,984
I apologize for all the ruckus the last few days.

900
01:03:00,984 --> 01:03:04,184
As an apology, we...

901
01:03:04,184 --> 01:03:07,684
prepared a song for everyone.

902
01:03:20,292 --> 01:03:22,783
Wow!

903
01:03:22,783 --> 01:03:24,792
Just do your homework.

904
01:03:24,817 --> 01:03:27,984
♪ Many misunderstandings ♪

905
01:03:27,984 --> 01:03:30,750
♪ Many incidents in life ♪

906
01:03:30,750 --> 01:03:33,692
- Please, enjoy.
- It looks great.

907
01:03:34,901 --> 01:03:36,192
♪ Still, good people are ♪

908
01:03:36,192 --> 01:03:38,109
Stay and eat with me.

909
01:03:39,051 --> 01:03:40,692
Please.

910
01:03:41,400 --> 01:03:43,109
♪ They exist ♪

911
01:03:43,109 --> 01:03:44,692
I have to wash my hands.

912
01:03:44,692 --> 01:03:47,151
♪ You may not like me right now ♪

913
01:03:47,151 --> 01:03:51,409
♪ Get to know me and I'm not so bad ♪

914
01:03:51,409 --> 01:03:54,434
Why isn't security answering!

915
01:03:54,434 --> 01:04:01,784
♪ I... will live happily here ♪

916
01:04:04,775 --> 01:04:10,101
♪ Life brings you joy, Life brings you pain ♪

917
01:04:10,101 --> 01:04:13,492
♪ Just share your struggles ♪

918
01:04:13,492 --> 01:04:15,192
♪ Depend on each other ♪

919
01:04:15,192 --> 01:04:19,901
♪ Life is too short, Just love each other ♪

920
01:04:19,901 --> 01:04:23,483
♪ Let's get along ♪
♪ Happily ♪

921
01:04:23,483 --> 01:04:27,192
♪ Let's live together ♪

922
01:04:27,192 --> 01:04:28,609
I'm calling the police!

923
01:04:28,609 --> 01:04:33,383
♪ Together for a hundred years ♪

924
01:04:51,801 --> 01:04:53,984
Up to this point,

925
01:04:53,984 --> 01:04:58,809
I believed our family's future would stay bright.

926
01:05:30,634 --> 01:05:32,399
Mom! Mom! Look at this!

927
01:05:32,399 --> 01:05:34,076
Mom, have a look!

928
01:05:34,076 --> 01:05:36,199
Come on, just look.

929
01:05:36,199 --> 01:05:39,584
It's him. This is Jihoo, right?

930
01:05:40,483 --> 01:05:42,509
Where is this?

931
01:05:42,509 --> 01:05:44,199
Where is this?

932
01:05:44,199 --> 01:05:46,009
Can't you tell? It's Seoul.

933
01:05:46,009 --> 01:05:48,659
They were still in Korea?

934
01:05:48,659 --> 01:05:50,567
I knew it.

935
01:05:50,567 --> 01:05:54,667
She tricked you, they're still here!

936
01:05:54,667 --> 01:05:59,317
Find them now. Search every elementary school.

937
01:06:01,859 --> 01:06:04,367
I'll kill them all!

938
01:06:44,280 --> 01:06:48,460
[Uncle]

939
01:06:48,460 --> 01:06:52,076
Since I destroyed the Momvelies and their plans...

940
01:06:52,076 --> 01:06:54,199
Our goal is survival.

941
01:06:54,199 --> 01:06:57,134
Jihoo's uncle should be our target.

942
01:06:57,134 --> 01:06:59,901
I'll be here every day. I'm stuck to you like a leech.

943
01:06:59,901 --> 01:07:03,992
What do I do when the boy I like, likes someone else?

944
01:07:03,992 --> 01:07:08,342
If they're happier with someone else...

945
01:07:08,342 --> 01:07:10,699
There's not much to do...

946
01:07:11,399 --> 01:07:13,399
- Jihoo!
- I said stop!

947
01:07:13,399 --> 01:07:14,399
Hey!

948
01:07:14,399 --> 01:07:15,942
Are you crazy!

949
01:07:15,942 --> 01:07:17,951
He might be asked to transfer.

950
01:07:17,951 --> 01:07:20,151
That makes you the same kind of person as your grandmother.

951
01:07:20,151 --> 01:07:21,199
Are you really my son?

952
01:07:21,199 --> 01:07:24,817
If I didn't exist, you would be happy.

953
01:07:24,817 --> 01:07:26,567
It's off. What do we do?

954
01:07:26,567 --> 01:07:28,399
Why did you push him into a corner!

955
01:07:28,399 --> 01:07:30,359
I'm your one and only, biggest fan...

956
01:07:30,359 --> 01:07:32,099
Can you please stop being my fan?

957
01:07:32,099 --> 01:07:35,292
Just keep it to yourself, Teacher.

958
01:07:39,530 --> 01:07:43,500
[Uncle]

959
01:07:45,420 --> 01:07:49,290
[Uncle]
